Your body starts to radiate shadows, increasing your darkness resistance by [10%, 15%, 18%, 22%, 25% (TL1-5)], armour by [5, 13, 19, 25, 30 (TL1-5)] and defence by [5, 13, 19, 25, 30 (TL1-5)].

Any time you absorb a soul the shadows pulse outward, dealing [108, 146, 175, 200, 222 (TL1-5; SP 100)] frostdusk damage to all foes in range [0, 1, 1, 2, 2 (TL1-5)] and knocking them back 3 tiles.

This can only happen once per turn.

The damage increases with your Spellpower.
